0..79 Comment "/// The default build stage: a package\'s `package.gandr.toml` body, rendered by"
80..137 Comment "/// a gandr function from its model\'s fields and modules."
138..141 Comment "///"
142..219 Comment "/// A package\'s own build stage is to write its manifest, the checker\'s fixed"
220..299 Comment "/// rule its default. Before the checker can run a stage, this source shows the"
300..369 Comment "/// default spelled in gandr: each run is the body of a manifest that"
370..395 Comment "/// `gandr check` writes."
396..399 Comment "///"
400..474 Comment "/// `body` reads the name, the version and the module list, and writes the"
475..554 Comment "/// `[package]` table as the checker does. The checker keeps the header and its"
555..635 Comment "/// BLAKE3 digest, which only it computes. A name holding a quote is not escaped"
636..684 Comment "/// here: that needs the characters of a string."
685..688 Comment "///"
689..705 Comment "/// - see: #2764"
706..722 Comment "/// - see: #2997"
723..739 Comment "/// - see: #2998"
740..812 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/projects/hello/package.gandr` — a model whose"
813..858 Comment "///   manifest `gandr check` writes beside it"
859..913 Comment "/// - see: `corpus/model/projects/tools/package.gandr`"
914..952 Comment "/// - see: `library/std/package.gandr`"
